10.0 -100. 100.0  ; nitial value, lower and upper bound (in DU)
0 0               ; First and last layer in which temperature is varied
200 160   340     ; mean T, lower and upper bound in K
T                 ; T: vertical grid automatically generated, F: Read pressure/altitude levels from a file
INP/TES_pres_grid.dat
T                 ; T: use tropopause, F: a fixed pressure as tropopause (e.g., 200 mb)
F 215.4   12   ; T: fixed tropopause based on pressure F: based on layer (from bottom); fixed pressure; fixed layer
T                 ; T: redivide layers between Pt and Ps, F: don't change layer scheme except for surface and tropopause
T                 ; define 2 km at layer

